  "prefLabel": "En 3001.02 Application of Rules",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 3001.02 Application of Rules.\n\n(a) This chapter shall apply to competitive natural gas suppliers as defined in En 3002.07 and aggregators as defined in En 3002.03.\n\n(b) This chapter shall not apply to the sale of natural gas to residential or non-residential customers by a local distribution company as defined in En 3002.13.\n\nSource. #14593, eff 5-21-26, EXPIRES: 5-21-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en3000.html"
